@startuml SD-2d
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-2d (Software level, CSMS billing) — No payment result 2 min after the 15-min expiry, and a late payment\nPrecondition: top-up is pending · System view: AD-2 · State: STM-4
footer Owner: Lê Bảo Khang (WP5) · v2.1 · 10/11/2026 · names = CD-2 class diagram · right gate = Payment Gateway

participant "«component»\n<u>:TopUpService</u>" as TS
participant "«component»\n<u>:CreditLedgerService</u>" as CL
participant "«port»\n<u>:VnpayAdapter</u>" as VA

== Timeout sweep at expiresAt + 2 min (expiresAt = creation + 15 min), no notification ==
[o-> TS ++ : onPendingTimeout(topUpId)  (DB-polled sweep, D7)
opt top-up still pending
  TS -> VA ++ : queryTransaction(ref) : status
  VA ->] : querydr [HTTPS]
  note right : {d ≤ 10 s}
  VA <--] : transaction status
  VA --> TS -- : status
  alt paid
    TS -> TS : pending → credited
    TS -> CL ++ : post(accountId, top_up, +amountVnd, topUpId)
    CL --> TS --
  else not paid
    TS -> TS : pending → expired (final)
    TS ->>] : notify Driver (MSG26)
  end
end
deactivate TS

== Notification arrives for an expired or failed top-up ==
[-> TS ++ : applyPaymentResult(ipn)  (from VnpayIpnController, SD-2b)
TS -> TS : record late payment (not credited, no invoice),\ntop-up stays expired / failed
TS ->>] : list on Billing Exceptions for an Admin refund (SD-2e)
[<-- TS -- : 00
@enduml
